id":"bdfdffa1-ce3d-40a9-98c0-7680e635f497","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"普通、言語サーバが「キー入力のたびに補完要求してください」っていう意思をクライアントに指示する場合、isIncomplete=true を返却する。というのが一般的なんですが\nlua-language-server は全 alphabet 文字といくつかの記号を triggerCharacters に指定してくるという動きをしているので。","ts":"1621405738.029100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":3,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UGN0T63GC","UL6CFN8NR"]},{"name":"sasu","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kGPGH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ac02511-c846-4293-a94b-18bb706e66a4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Lua の LSP で workspace.library も設定して使ってますが遅いとは感じないですね。もしかしたら coc 特有かもしれない。（冤罪の可能性もかなりありますが）\nlua-language-server ってかなり特殊な LS なんですよね。。。","ts":"1621405671.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IA/QH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7b23313-0736-4385-a996-e12f0a3b432b","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私はworkspace.library入れると起動がかなり遅くなって使い物にならない感じなんですよね・・・\nなんかおかしいな・・・","ts":"1621405543.026200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dbEg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cceedf40-7f96-40d3-bbbc-403acda7b1a0","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"pyright 外部パッケージまで読みにいってるみたいなんですよね。それが原因かなーと漠然と思ってます。","ts":"1621405522.025700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z4eZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b715960-a233-4eb3-964d-cb98f57b8064","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"(ちなみにCocです","ts":"1621405465.024300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pe="}]},{"client_msg_id":"0566f803-7fba-4dc3-89b2-b15a3ec5cece","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"pyright結構遅いですね… Diagnosisとか特に","ts":"1621405450.023600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0SC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6084cf5e-5430-4272-b734-1e8582e9759b","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"設定はこんな感じにしてます。\n```  require('lspconfig').sumneko_lua.setup {\n    cmd = { sumneko_binary, \"-E\", sumneko_root_path .. \"/main.lua\" },\n    on_attach = custom_attach,\n    settings = {\n      Lua = {\n        diagnostics = { globals = { 'vim', \"packer_plugins\" } },\n        runtime = { version = 'LuaJIT', path = vim.split(package.path, \";\") },\n        workspace = {\n          library = {\n            [vim.fn.expand('$VIMRUNTIME/lua')] = true,\n            [vim.fn.expand('$VIMRUNTIME/lua/vim/lsp')] = true,\n          },\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  }```\n","ts":"1621405447.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7KPg5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6fce98d-0e3e-4d0b-a049-bd8a75cef026","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"個人的には python の LSP (pyright) の方が気になる…","ts":"1621405211.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"no4xd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68886071-74ee-45c5-899e-831d2648cc53","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"自分は特に気にならないですが (sumneko_lua 使ってます)。","ts":"1621405126.020300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MF7c7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8900ed1f-5c0d-41db-b509-c573d0b3d712","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"LuaのLSP使ってLua書いてる人いますか？動作（インサートしてなにか打ったとき）遅くないですか？","ts":"1621404890.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":fal